      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-180 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 11,
      "blockIndex": 7,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p082-c7",
      "start": 869,
      "end": 887,
      "groups": [
        "p082-textual-coordination-edfa510c20"
      ],
      "sourceText": "كِرَامًا كَاتِبِينَ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p082-u0011",
      "text": "که آنچه را [از خیر و شر] انجام می دهید، می دانند [و ضبط می کنند.]",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(10) > span:nth-of-type(2)",
      "textHash": "57ae07fa5eb61de2310308d8b3b82d4c35cdf7302a8d83d41c39a8ca47dd0396",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-180 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 12,
      "blockIndex": 7,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p082-c7",
      "start": 896,
      "end": 965,
      "groups": [
        "p082-textual-coordination-edfa510c20"
      ],
      "sourceText": "يَعْلَمُونَ مَا تَفْعَلُونَ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p082-u0012",
      "text": "[که] روز پاداش در آن درآیند،",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(12) > span:nth-of-type(4)",
      "textHash": "daa50fe51083d89eadee149f53594ea3c0c9675d084a62802239d3ec45c409b9",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-100 ul-pad-x-0mm ul-pad-y-1px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0mm ul-pad-y-1px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 15,
      "blockIndex": 8,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p082-c8",
      "start": 1100,
      "end": 1128,
      "groups": [
        "p082-textual-coordination-d57c8a26f7"
      ],
      "sourceText": "يَصْلَوْنَهَا يَوْمَ الدِّينِ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p082-u0013",
      "text": "آنان از دوزخ غایب نمی شوند",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(12) > span:nth-of-type(5)",
      "textHash": "2855d326dae241cb8caa77aff0e282967f6100ac1bb8c721a03795c2a3ce4786",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-100 ul-pad-x-0mm ul-pad-y-1px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0mm ul-pad-y-1px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 16,
      "blockIndex": 8,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p082-c8",
      "start": 1132,
      "end": 1159,
      "groups": [
        "p082-textual-coordination-d57c8a26f7"
      ],
      "sourceText": "مَا هُمْ عَنْهَا بِغَائِبِينَ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p082-u0014",
      "text": "تو چه می دانی روز جزا چیست؟",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(13) > span:nth-of-type(1)",
      "textHash": "0345ad4491c6ca2962b8d0beb8c5e4ebbf624ac6cac41f09fba5280feb68d679",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-100 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 17,
      "blockIndex": 9,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p082-c9",
      "start": 1179,
      "end": 1207,
      "groups": [
        "p082-local-underline-pattern-f03920dd82"
      ],
      "sourceText": "مَا أَدْرَاكَ مَا يَوْمُ الدِّينِ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p082-u0015",
      "text": "چه می دانی روز جزا چیست؟",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(14) > span:nth-of-type(1)",
      "textHash": "2fdde3dda1a2707668d20387283c4010bef5229b3ae17f61dd407ec347d74fdf",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-100 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 18,
      "blockIndex": 10,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p082-c10",
      "start": 1229,
      "end": 1254,
      "groups": [
        "p082-local-underline-pattern-f03920dd82"
      ],
      "sourceText": "مَا أَدْرَاكَ مَا يَوْمُ الدِّينِ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p082-u0016",
      "text": "کسی از کسی چیزی از عذاب را دفع نمی کند،",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(15) > span:nth-of-type(1)",
      "textHash": "605f83acb8e52093306d850c3670dcce87a08a8507aa2ee3eabf4162fa67766c",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-180 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 19,
      "blockIndex": 11,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p082-c11",
      "start": 1279,
      "end": 1320,
      "groups": [
        "p082-textual-coordination-e244efc74a"
      ],
      "sourceText": "لَا تَمْلِكُ نَفْسٌ لِّنَفْسٍ شَيْئًا"
    },
    {
      "id": "p082-u0017",
      "text": "در آن روز، فرمان و حکم ویژه خداست.",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(15) > span:nth-of-type(2)",
      "textHash": "732450b834de0a42c0d068d8583d70504d18e87985fa3877287d758b0f17f89f",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-180 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 19,
      "blockIndex": 11,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p082-c11",
      "start": 1323,
      "end": 1357,
      "groups": [
        "p082-textual-coordination-e244efc74a"
      ],
      "sourceText": "الْأَمْرُ يَوْمَئِذٍ لِّلَّهِ"
